<%- include('partials/header', {
    title: typeof title !== 'undefined' ? title : 'Terms & Conditions | Qualitick Collections',
    page: 'terms',
    description: 'Terms and Conditions for Qualitick Collections - Product information, pricing, payments, delivery, returns, warranty, and liability policies.',
    keywords: 'terms and conditions, terms of service, qualitick collections, warranty, returns policy',
    canonicalUrl: typeof canonicalUrl !== 'undefined' ? canonicalUrl : 'https://qualitick-collections.com/terms',
    url: typeof url !== 'undefined' ? url : '/terms',
    ogType: 'website'
}) %>

<!-- TERMS & CONDITIONS PAGE -->

<!-- ── HERO ── -->
<section class="tc-hero">
    <div class="tc-hero-inner">
        <span class="tc-eyebrow">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="tc-hero-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="tc-hero-sub">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>
        <p class="tc-hero-desc">Please read these terms carefully before placing an order. By purchasing from Qualitick Collections, you agree to be bound by the following.</p>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/icons/watermark.svg" alt="" class="tc-hero-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
</section>

<!-- ── BREADCRUMB ── -->
<div class="tc-breadcrumb">
    <div class="tc-breadcrumb-inner">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i>
        <span>Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── CONTENT ── -->
<div class="tc-body">
    <div class="tc-body-inner">

        <!-- Product Information -->
        <div class="tc-section">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i></div>
                <h2>Product Information</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <p>We provide accurate and detailed information about every timepiece in our collection. All images shared on our Instagram and Facebook pages are actual product images unless otherwise stated — what you see is exactly what you receive.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing and Payments -->
        <div class="tc-section">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-money-bill-wave"></i></div>
                <h2>Pricing &amp; Payments</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <p>Prices are clearly displayed on each product listing. We accept the following payment methods:</p>
                <ul class="tc-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Mobile Money — MTN &amp; Airtel</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Bank Transfer — FNB and other major banks</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Secure online payment channels communicated at checkout</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Flexible Payment Options -->
        <div class="tc-section">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-credit-card"></i></div>
                <h2>Flexible Payment Options</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <p>We believe everyone deserves a quality timepiece. Our flexible plans are designed to make your dream watch achievable. Availability of Layby and Hire Purchase may vary by product and is only valid with documented proof of communication.</p>

                <div class="tc-plan-grid">
                    <!-- Layby -->
                    <div class="tc-plan-card">
                        <div class="tc-plan-head">
                            <div class="tc-plan-icon"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i></div>
                            <h3>Layby</h3>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="tc-list">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Deposit:</strong> Minimum 30% upfront to secure your order</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Duration:</strong> Balance paid in one or more payments within <strong>90 days</strong></span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Collection:</strong> Item reserved immediately; dispatched after full balance is cleared</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>No hidden fees:</strong> You only pay the agreed product price — nothing extra</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Default:</strong> Order may be cancelled and deposit forfeited if balance is not settled within the 90-day period</span></li>
                        </ul>
                        <a href="/layby" class="tc-plan-link">Learn more about Layby <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Hire Purchase -->
                    <div class="tc-plan-card">
                        <div class="tc-plan-head">
                            <div class="tc-plan-icon"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div>
                            <h3>Hire Purchase</h3>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="tc-list">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Deposit:</strong> 75% upfront</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Duration:</strong> Balance paid within <strong>90 days</strong></span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Must have made at least one prior purchase and provided feedback</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Delivery:</strong> Item dispatched after initial payment; balance settled within the 90-day period</span></li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span><strong>Default:</strong> If balance is not settled within 90 days, the watch may be recalled or the sale cancelled</span></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pre-Orders & Delivery -->
        <div class="tc-section">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-shipping-fast"></i></div>
                <h2>Pre-Orders &amp; Delivery</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <ul class="tc-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Orders can be placed via direct message or through our website</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>In-stock items are dispatched within <strong>2 business days</strong></span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Pre-order items are delivered within <strong>10–12 business days</strong></span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Qualitick Collections is not responsible for delays caused by couriers, unforeseen circumstances, or incorrect delivery details provided by the buyer</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Returns and Refunds -->
        <div class="tc-section">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-undo-alt"></i></div>
                <h2>Returns &amp; Refunds</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <p>Returns are accepted only if the watch is defective or damaged upon delivery.</p>
                <ul class="tc-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Issues must be reported within <strong>48 hours</strong> of delivery</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless otherwise agreed</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Refunds are processed within <strong>15–20 business days</strong> after inspection and approval</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Warranty -->
        <div class="tc-section">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
                <h2>Warranty Policy</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <p>At Qualitick Collections, we stand behind the quality of our products. This warranty policy outlines the coverage and conditions under which we provide support for defective items.</p>

                <h3 class="tc-subheading">Coverage</h3>
                <p>Our watches are covered under a <strong>limited warranty against manufacturing defects</strong>, including:</p>
                <ul class="tc-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Faulty movement (watch not keeping time correctly)</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Defective internal components</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Manufacturing faults affecting normal use</span></li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="tc-subheading">Warranty Period</h3>
                <p>Warranty is valid for <strong>3–6 months</strong> from the date of delivery.</p>

                <h3 class="tc-subheading">What Is Not Covered</h3>
                <ul class="tc-list tc-list--cross">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-times"></i><span>Physical damage (drops, impact, cracked glass)</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-times"></i><span>Water damage (unless explicitly rated and used correctly)</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-times"></i><span>Battery depletion or normal wear and tear</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-times"></i><span>Strap damage due to regular use</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-times"></i><span>Damage caused by misuse or improper handling</span></li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="tc-subheading">How to Make a Claim</h3>
                <ol class="tc-list tc-list--numbered">
                    <li><span>Contact us via WhatsApp or email</span></li>
                    <li><span>Provide proof of purchase</span></li>
                    <li><span>Share clear images or videos showing the issue</span></li>
                    <li><span>Await assessment and confirmation</span></li>
                </ol>

                <h3 class="tc-subheading">Resolution Options</h3>
                <p>If your claim is approved, we may repair the product, replace it, or offer a suitable alternative if a replacement is unavailable.</p>

                <h3 class="tc-subheading">Delivery for Warranty Claims</h3>
                <ul class="tc-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>If confirmed as a manufacturing defect — we cover return or replacement delivery costs</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>If not covered under warranty — delivery costs are the customer's responsibility</span></li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="tc-subheading">Important Notes</h3>
                <ul class="tc-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Warranty is valid only for the original purchaser</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Products must be returned in reasonable condition (excluding the defect)</span></li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i><span>Claims must be made within the warranty period</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Limitation of Liability -->
        <div class="tc-section">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i></div>
                <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <p>Qualitick Collections is not liable for delays caused by courier services, payment processors, or circumstances beyond our reasonable control. Once delivery has been confirmed by the courier or recipient, we cannot be held responsible for lost or stolen items.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact -->
        <div class="tc-section tc-section-contact">
            <div class="tc-section-header">
                <div class="tc-section-icon"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></div>
                <h2>Questions About These Terms?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="tc-section-body">
                <p>Reach us through our <a href="/contact" class="tc-link">contact page</a> — include your order number if your question relates to an existing purchase.</p>
                <div class="tc-contact-btns">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-hero-primary">Contact Us <img src="/images/icons/Arrow-Icon.svg" alt=""></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
